description "Rakghoul Infected

Infected Mutants of the Rakghoul Plague, Enhanced in Strength and their will to fight, but their intellegence suffers.

^2Weaponry:
- Rakghoul Melee
-- Poisons
-- 50%- Damage
-- Can Only Punch, Slap and Grab

^5Powers:
- Infection Spree (Fury 3) ^3[CS3]

^8Attributes:
- Reinforcements (4)
- No weapon pickups
- No Gunbash
- 50% slower Skill Cd
- 40% Less KB Taken
- 200%+ Damage Given
- 300% slower Hacking
- Healing (1)
- Assemble (3)

^3Abilities:
- Shoulder Barge ^3[CS2]"